{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Review standard degree lengths and increase support for two-year degrees",
        "additional_details": "Many countries deliver equivalent qualifications in that time, and some UK universities already offer accelerated 2 year degrees\r\n\r\nThis petition is not calling for all university degrees to be shortened. Many courses, particularly those involving placements, laboratory work or clinical training, require 3 years or longer. However, where the same qualification and learning outcomes can be achieved through more intensive study, we believe students should have the option to complete their degree in 2 years as this could reduce student debt, lower costs and help graduates enter the workforce sooner without reducing academic standards.",
        "background": "Review standard university degree lengths and support better access to 2 year degrees where students can achieve the same qualification and learning outcomes without reducing standards. ",
